
Property Wizard -> Controller: User input
Controller -> Repositories: Create Property
Repositories -> StoredProcedures: Persist Property
Controller -> Repositories: Add Amenities
Repositories -> StoredProcedures: Persist Amenities
Controller -> PhotoStorageService: Upload Photos (temp)
PhotoStorageService -> AzureBlobStorage: Store Temp Blobs
Controller -> PhotoStorageService: Copy Temp to Permanent
PhotoStorageService -> AzureBlobStorage: Store Permanent Blobs
Controller -> Repositories: Add Photo Metadata
Repositories -> StoredProcedures: Persist Photo Metadata
Controller -> Session: Store Wizard State
Session -> Controller: Retrieve Wizard State
AzureBlobStorage -> PhotoStorageService: Retrieve Photo
StoredProcedures -> Repositories: Return IDs/Status
Repositories -> Controller: Return IDs/Status
Controller -> View: Render UI
